From 61cd4861ad746662058cc7d4bdb3f84e21228d84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ientzy <ientzy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:07:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] Flash Next DFlash2: windows up to 15 with copy extension

The verify window may be wider than the 7 drafts of the drafter (up to 15).
The session sends the tokens that followed an earlier matching stretch of the
sequence as a copy hint (NINFER_FLASH_DFLASH2_COPY=<match length>), following
the source across a changed token or two. When the drafts repeat the hint, the
round goes on with the tokens of the hint after them.

Also: a drafter round no longer projects the unused MTP head, and the top-16
of the drafter runs in 32 segments per column plus a merge by rank.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
